          "_name": "features18",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features18\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\" checked>\n        <header>Card</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Link\" name=\"showLink\">\n        <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"columns\">\n            <option value=\"3\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"12\" selected>1</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#232323\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"mbr-section-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">Why Choose OSO ARUBA JEEP TOURS?</h4>\n                <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">At OSO ARUBA JEEP TOURS, we specialize in creating unforgettable off-road adventures tailored to your preferences. Here’s why we’re the best choice for your Jeep tour:</h5>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row mt-4\">\n            \n            <div class=\"item features-without-image mb-3 col-12 col-md-{{columns}} active\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper mb-4\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-left\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showText || showLink\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\">What can you expect from a OSO Jeep tour?</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .link\">The <a href=\"OSO-Half-Day-Jeep-Tour-Aruba.html\" class=\"text-success\">Half-Day</a> &amp; <a href=\"OSO-Full-Day-Jeep-Tour-Aruba.html\" class=\"text-success\">Full-Day</a> Tours: Options ranging from 4 to 8 hours are a wonderful introduction to Aruba and a perfect way to see the main sights and attractions.&nbsp;Spend the day exploring the breathtaking island of Aruba, where stunning landscapes and off-the-beaten-path adventures await.</p>\n                        <div class=\"link-wrap\">\n                            <h6 class=\"link mbr-fonts-style align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showLink\" data-app-selector=\".link\">\n                                <a class=\"text-primary\" href=\"#\">Learn more &gt;</a>\n                            </h6>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image mb-3 col-12 col-md-{{columns}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper mb-4\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-left\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showText || showLink\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\">The Thrill of Off-Roading</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .link\">\n                            Choosing a jeep tour for your Aruba experience is the perfect way to combine adventure, comfort, and breathtaking views. Whether you're after a smooth scenic ride or an adrenaline-packed off-road adventure, OSO ARUBA JEEP TOURS has the <a href=\"ARUBA-ADVENTURE-JEEP-TOURS.html\" class=\"text-success\">perfect island tour</a> for you.&nbsp;</p>\n                        <div class=\"link-wrap\">\n                            <h6 class=\"link mbr-fonts-style align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showLink\" data-app-selector=\".link\">\n                                <a class=\"text-primary\" href=\"#\">Learn more &gt;</a>\n                            </h6>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image mb-3 col-12 col-md-{{columns}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper mb-4\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-left\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showText || showLink\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\">Guided Expertise and Local Insights</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .link\">\n                            Throughout the tour experience from our local guides, you’ll learn about Aruba's beautiful areas while they explain the island's history, geology, flora, and fauna.<br></p>\n                        <div class=\"link-wrap\">\n                            <h6 class=\"link mbr-fonts-style align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showLink\" data-app-selector=\".link\">\n                                <a class=\"text-primary\" href=\"#\">Learn more &gt;</a>\n                            </h6>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "Guided-Jeep-Tour-Island-Highlights",
