        "title": "OSO ISLAND PRIVATE JEEP TOUR",
        "meta_descr": "Our island private jeep tour starts at your accommodation and heads to the northwest point of the island, with its first stop at the California Lighthouse, then the Gold Mill Ruins, alongside the scenic north coast to the Natural Bridge, Natural Pool, and Baby Beach.",
